It took Anna 10 years to recover from the death of her husband, Sean, but now she's on
the verge of marrying her boyfriend, Joseph, and finally moving on.

4
00:21:03,157 --> 00:21:09,157
However, on the night of her engagement party, a young boy named Sean
turns up, saying he is her dead husband reincarnated.

5
00:26:18,947 --> 00:26:24,947
At first she ignores the child, but his knowledge of her former husband's life is
uncanny, leading her to believe that he might be telling the truth.

